Cell["\<\
For an example of each network type, I compare the exact link dynamical \
importance with the eigenvector-based theoretical approximation proposed by \
Restrepo, Ott and Hunt.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.598452093952716*^9, 3.598452204485716*^9}, {
