   3.8053682120110083`*^9}, {3.8053682718437815`*^9, 
   3.8053683269435396`*^9}, {3.8053683619824047`*^9, 3.805368707126303*^9}, {
   3.80536876819514*^9, 3.8053688654388213`*^9}, {3.805368933520688*^9, 
   3.805368980534671*^9}, {3.8053690139001265`*^9, 3.8053691639045515`*^9}, {
   3.8053692441480365`*^9, 3.80536931864217*^9}, {3.8168635272309895`*^9, 
   3.8168635845935636`*^9}, {3.816863685372053*^9, 3.81686375134494*^9}, {
   3.81686388120994*^9, 3.816863947167095*^9}, {3.816863997606894*^9, 
   3.816864003864453*^9}, {3.8168640429415116`*^9, 3.8168641026916676`*^9}, {
   3.816864152463027*^9, 3.8168641981214075`*^9}, {3.816864244975381*^9, 
   3.816864375626174*^9}, 3.816864417900835*^9, {3.816864768372254*^9, 
   3.8168648184505634`*^9}, {3.81686489575659*^9, 3.8168649131099777`*^9}, 
   3.8168651685425525`*^9, {3.8168652416985393`*^9, 3.816865263315713*^9}, {
   3.8168657034067287`*^9, 3.816865755449794*^9}, {3.9987358638923492`*^9, 
   3.998735864824032*^9}, {3.9987361400279846`*^9, 3.9987361482709713`*^9}, {
   3.9987400080275993`*^9, 3.9987400098471966`*^9}},
 TextJustification->0.,
 Background->RGBColor[
  1, 0.9, 0.8],ExpressionUUID->"fa04d8c9-0ba5-4276-aa95-5753460abb7c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Note that for a matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3040db91-53a9-44f9-88b4-ad893b5ca033"],
 " that satisfies the conditions of the Perron-Frobenius theorem, we know \
that the largest eigenvalue ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Lambda]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "64379c9f-803b-4adf-8917-cba4618b7a7e"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6df91968-f93e-47db-bf0a-3c4984ad18ea"],
 " is positive and real. Furthermore, using the spectral representation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a414c81d-270e-4a17-9d21-ac7897993960"],
 ", we can show that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["A", "m"], ".", 
      OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"]}], 
     "\[TildeTilde]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "m"], "(", 
       RowBox[{"u", "\[CircleTimes]", "v"}], ")"}], ".", 
      OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"]}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "m"], "(", 
      RowBox[{"v", ".", 
       OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"]}], ")"}], 
     "u"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "75d74bf3-0eb4-4cde-8285-501e419333ec"],
 " and that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"], ".", 
      SuperscriptBox["A", "m"]}], "\[TildeTilde]", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "m"], 
      RowBox[{
       OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"], ".", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"u", "\[CircleTimes]", "v"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "m"], "(", 
      RowBox[{"u", ".", 
       OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"]}], ")"}], 
     "v"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "726f4530-6f7a-4135-8c19-60a679258f02"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["u", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "671afc9a-9324-4497-bfcd-2a44126c1e69"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["v", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "39886040-9604-4a68-9158-9e65e9482f2f"],
 " are the right and left eigenvectors respectively corresponding to the \
eigenvalue of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "937ed6ee-9e2c-405b-a98c-c0b9c9941369"],
 " with largest absolute value. Note that entry ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "87cb8517-f2bd-446c-be6c-5717abb87bce"],
 " of the vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["A", "m"], ".", 
    OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"d214473b-8ff4-49f9-b43f-6e272910fe8a"],
 " yields the number of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["m", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3e9783e0-370e-4fbe-873f-2e346d71e180"],
 "-step outgoing links from node ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "149860bf-db24-4966-891a-991624df88c5"],
 " while entry ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5b36a440-91f0-4ee7-ad1e-ee534db13a1f"],
 " of the vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "\[RightVector]"], ".", 
    SuperscriptBox["A", "m"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "28716ef7-52e9-495f-bb83-f7ae11d956ac"],
 " yields the number of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["m", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "648ff947-fd6d-4fa5-afd8-fd680342732b"],
 " step links into node ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "134d3c3b-b6ea-4cb2-9b9b-d6e729d7d424"],
 " for the network corresponding to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "41669cd0-9989-465a-b061-dbd818c1a9f1"],
 ". Thus, the change in the value of \[Lambda] upon the removal of an \
existing link or node are a measure of the degree to which said removal \
affects the number of multiple step paths through all of the nodes in the \
network and is thus a global measure, which distinguishes it from the measure \
of eigenvector centrality. For example, we might have a network consisting of \
two subgraphs, with one subgraph very large and one very small. Now, it may \
be that a node in the smaller subnetwork has a very large eigenvector \
centrality relative to other nodes, but because this node is completely \
disconnected from the large subnetwork, its dynamical importance will be low. \
Note also that the reasoning above obviously implies that the removal of a \
node or link will always lead to a reduction in the largest eigenvalue of the \
corresponding adjacency matrix. Now, the command below generates an Erdos-R\
\[EAcute]nyi network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e15ccd23-1bd6-4602-afdd-5e82c67ad1fc"],
 " consisting of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["100", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7ae365b2-d348-4527-84da-e399d6bf4375"],
 " nodes with no self-loops where there is a probability ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0.1", " "}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ca1a2a02-bf16-47d4-9215-5c6bad701a0f"],
 "of any link ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"i", "\[Rule]", "j"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b1d13eac-f280-4b75-a320-28d6246989a9"],
 " (such that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"i", "\[NotEqual]", "j"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "78d27526-7442-430c-8678-55d659a3d58f"],
 ") existing. It then generates a list \[CapitalDelta]Evl1 containing, for \
each possible link in the network, the relative change in the largest \
eigenvalue of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bbdb7e7e-f31c-475e-9be2-449e8dca526e"],
 " when we add/remove a given link from the network. In order to increase the \
speed of computation, we amend the function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "[", 
    RowBox[{"A", ",", "\[Lambda]"}], "]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d4334529-908a-4e4d-a9bc-2edd4f6e8b82"],
 " above so that it calculates the numerical change in the largest eigenvalue \
when we add/remove a link from the network:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.81937596072278*^9, 3.8193760971986384`*^9}, {
  3.8193761502995667`*^9, 3.819376307870982*^9}, {3.819376340929533*^9, 
  3.819376485304258*^9}, {3.8193836134097395`*^9, 3.8193836149396443`*^9}, {
  3.8193836653956485`*^9, 3.819383667157934*^9}, {3.8194568785131273`*^9, 
  3.819457183455964*^9}, {3.819625201288958*^9, 3.8196252094362044`*^9}, {
  3.8196252678409576`*^9, 3.819625268617876*^9}, {3.819638897597355*^9, 
  3.819638909298072*^9}, {3.8196389502974143`*^9, 3.819638967533305*^9}, {
  3.8196390313965006`*^9, 3.8196390321086073`*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"bb444628-6a3f-4361-849f-12833d62efad"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"A1", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["A", "1"], "[", 
    RowBox[{"0.1", ",", "100"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "1"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", "A1", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[CapitalDelta]Evl1",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"d", "[", 
   RowBox[{"A1", ",", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "1"]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.8193763162415886`*^9, {3.8194361893433275`*^9, 3.819436191346595*^9}},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[542]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6eb13780-b143-4593-9a9c-7e84e140aa0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The command below now generates a list of points in two-dimensional space \
with coordinates drawn from the distributions described in the first \
sub-question of part ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e7e8ca28-e5c9-4a47-9479-b1034b70dace"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8193765167561083`*^9, 3.8193765192384663`*^9}, {
  3.819377166559554*^9, 3.8193771680056844`*^9}, {3.819377209432845*^9, 
  3.819377227892456*^9}, {3.8193828915740128`*^9, 3.819383266566721*^9}, {
  3.819454343229117*^9, 3.819454350070846*^9}, {3.8194574171406517`*^9, 
  3.819457418364012*^9}, {3.819639054593454*^9, 3.8196390548069153`*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"4426e2d6-f37b-461b-a281-370d8b0bdf2b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Nodes", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"Y", "[", 
   RowBox[{"4", ",", "5", ",", "100"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.817733609322156*^9, 3.8177336107982097`*^9}, {
   3.8177336565569324`*^9, 3.817733664573502*^9}, {3.8190094670992928`*^9, 
   3.819009477264649*^9}, {3.8194006834954743`*^9, 3.8194007950805964`*^9}, 
   3.8196390844815345`*^9},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[882]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0f814987-a92e-47dd-bca5-4346d841c385"],

