 CellChangeTimes->{3.819209429544853*^9, 3.8192094779181433`*^9, 
  3.819437633276213*^9, 3.819437700090087*^9, 3.8196218476375732`*^9},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "Out[852]=",ExpressionUUID->"c00e40c1-80b2-4001-886f-1e9fccd57bc1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Meanwhile, the rightmost plot above corresponds to the case of the network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6535d56b-7fb0-47a5-8916-4d91459cc42e"],
 ". We see in this case that the ordering of the nodes is even less well \
preserved by equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", "5", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "16bd8d02-b816-4d8e-8e53-6765bcf9b009"],
 ". This is a result of the fact that network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b7b0aaff-6fc4-44d1-b5db-bce59cc1dad6"],
 " has even less connections than ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7a3886c2-5f04-42ff-ab72-ce3bce131e0b"],
 ", which compounds the effect described in the previous paragraph, but also \
reflects the fact that the network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f7256aef-fb49-4a0c-957e-8f984d01f36d"],
 " is assortative, which accentuates differences in the total degree across \
nodes over longer distances and results in even greater differences in \
eigenvector centralities, resulting in the condition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["v", "k"], 
      SubscriptBox["u", "k"]}], 
     RowBox[{"v", ".", "u"}]], 
    RowBox[{"<<", "1"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4b46c680-d270-43e4-93ef-14ca3505bece"],
 " for all ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "0866be48-b17c-4820-95b2-d835a72cf5b4"],
 " failing. Thus, the deviation from linearity in the rightmost plot above is \
greater than in the leftmost plot as a result of the fact that the network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d74f5413-2880-4751-b235-30fab2e690a6"],
 " is assortative while ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "077d15e3-042d-40aa-8202-8c31d22cbea4"],
 " is not, and also due to the fact that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "23b8c7c0-df4b-4581-818d-f74dcc5f3e88"],
 " has a lower number of connections than does ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f009d145-2106-4ca6-90c7-29ff4fb1d0a5"],
 ". The plots below now show the relationship between the dynamical \
importance of a node in the two networks generated and the root of the \
product of the in-degree and out-degree of the node in question (with the \
leftmost plot corresponding to the network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e227b6fc-8579-4e6c-81ea-45f5ebf4dcfc"],
 "). Note that since equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", "5", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d3461857-0a03-4244-97fb-add70890d89f"],
 " does not preserve the ordering of the nodes in terms of their dynamical \
importance in either case, the vertical coordinates correspond to dynamical \
importances calculated from their definition: "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8194469815508213`*^9, 3.8194471476758795`*^9}, {
   3.819447238407302*^9, 3.8194472697315383`*^9}, {3.8194474140378284`*^9, 
   3.8194475002378073`*^9}, {3.819447643842634*^9, 3.8194477719604645`*^9}, 
   3.819447847852003*^9, {3.819448035146343*^9, 3.819448299259823*^9}, {
   3.8196196874563713`*^9, 3.819619689283486*^9}, {3.819626282883116*^9, 
   3.81962634944213*^9}, {3.819640047003014*^9, 3.819640068456665*^9}, {
   3.8196401068399677`*^9, 3.8196401414044952`*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"260dbd23-5716-4ba1-9c92-9224294a9127"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"GraphicsGrid", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ListPlot", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox[
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Total", "[", "A1", "]"}], "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}], 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "A1", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], 
            FractionBox["1", "2"]], 
           StyleBox[",",
            FontWeight->"Bold"], 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]Evn1", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}],
             FontWeight->"Bold"]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "1", ",", "100"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", "Full"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
