Cell[TextData[{
 "Note first of all that the points comprising the plot corresponding to the \
networks in SampleD above generally take smaller values on the horizontal \
axis, which is a result of the fact that the probability of any given link \
existing for the networks in this sample is smaller than the corresponding \
probability for the Erdos-R\[EAcute]nyi networks in SampleC, which results in \
the average degree of nodes corresponding to networks in SampleD being \
significantly lower than in SampleC. Furthermore, we see that the rate of \
increase in the general trend of the red points is far greater than the \
corresponding rate of increase for the blue points, which is a result of the \
fact that the networks in SampleD are assortative, so that nodes with a high \
degree are likely to be connected to nodes which also have a high degree, \
leading to the dynamical importance of a node increasing significantly as it \
becomes more connected locally. Meanwhile, the Erdos-R\[EAcute]nyi networks \
in SampleC will generally have an assortativity of zero, which means that the \
correlation between the degree of a node and its dynamical importance will be \
relatively low for reasons which we explained in the previous sub-question. \
Thus, the data above validates our initial findings for the networks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "818c2336-afe4-486b-a66f-6add6b1e5f7f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "542a3941-16e1-46f6-80e4-cf244514ca05"],
 " with parameter values ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"p", "=", "0.1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b4e376f2-150f-4693-b965-0738084a28ec"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", "=", "0.75"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "15ad6257-9b7e-43a1-acb2-3f4d50bd0d7b"],
 ". Now, the list SampleE below contains ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["500", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "88e7fda5-4ea1-4b42-ab2f-51f0ad97e359"],
 " adjacency matrices corresponding to networks of the type ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b3e7255b-b69b-4c13-a0e4-d57224ea5b2b"],
 " with the parameter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "891d02c8-2f5a-4f38-8786-fcc0c7b14631"],
 " set to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0.9", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bfcc34b1-9359-4161-9be7-28ad2798bc25"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.818958369103905*^9, 3.818958435720874*^9}, {
  3.819527187773225*^9, 3.819527210650696*^9}, {3.8195352545246444`*^9, 
  3.81953525585739*^9}, {3.8195353656226835`*^9, 3.8195353684246345`*^9}, {
  3.8195388105700717`*^9, 3.8195388143272657`*^9}, {3.8195389092289543`*^9, 
  3.8195390344006767`*^9}, {3.819539077976413*^9, 3.819539383852203*^9}, {
  3.8195394346691246`*^9, 3.8195397824580956`*^9}, {3.8195400901753435`*^9, 
  3.8195400925777473`*^9}, {3.8195401605046644`*^9, 3.819540174073327*^9}, {
  3.8195420617708015`*^9, 3.81954209312311*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"fbe69d9a-41e0-4fd1-9455-c30ff9e7d21b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SampleE", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Sample", "[", 
    RowBox[{"0.9", ",", "100", ",", "500"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8177219752455425`*^9, 3.8177220323577595`*^9}, 
   3.817905108019936*^9, 3.8179058606252356`*^9, {3.8188545524254684`*^9, 
   3.8188545656344943`*^9}, {3.8189353638834944`*^9, 
   3.8189353660227747`*^9}, {3.81946895784623*^9, 3.819468958878462*^9}},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[626]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6e4d121e-ef5f-4f4c-a4ef-cd664b22f5f5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Meanwhile, the command below generates a single adjacency matrix of the \
type in SampleE. It then creates a list \[CapitalDelta]EvnE whose ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "05d4df44-0dd3-456d-b1f8-0fb5cd5afd47"],
 "-th element yields the dynamical importance of node ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b11e0a28-b78c-4c56-b320-205ae3160d3c"],
 " with respect to the network in question:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8195274486846313`*^9, 3.8195275515234804`*^9}, {
   3.8195275828163967`*^9, 3.8195276477832365`*^9}, {3.819542135074009*^9, 
   3.819542137030094*^9}, {3.819548727647435*^9, 3.8195487318678217`*^9}, 
   3.8195488166043015`*^9, {3.819626596294877*^9, 3.819626624351822*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"ddb02ae6-effa-45ce-8bbe-6db135059399"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"C1", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["A", "1"], "[", 
    RowBox[{"0.9", ",", "100"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", "A3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[CapitalDelta]EvnE",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"f", "[", 
   RowBox[{"A3", ",", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8189374411432247`*^9, 3.818937483348445*^9}, {
  3.818952023410019*^9, 3.8189520235216846`*^9}, {3.8189560418725867`*^9, 
  3.8189560651174574`*^9}, {3.819469026184645*^9, 3.8194690577718163`*^9}, {
  3.8195487207881064`*^9, 3.8195487381216755`*^9}, {3.81962694324391*^9, 
  3.8196269458389697`*^9}},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[865]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f07607eb-0428-415c-8ee3-ce674286147b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The plot below now shows how accurately the dynamical importances of the \
nodes in the network ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["C1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3b939906-e450-4f82-9b3e-3635b31f09ea"],
 " are represented by equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", "5", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "af17ebbc-9c2d-4e6c-bbb1-f6fc19c85322"],
 " from the paper by Restrepo, Ott and Hunt (2006):"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8189406290925817`*^9, 3.818940638777695*^9}, {
  3.818940669182423*^9, 3.8189406976463704`*^9}, {3.819529710539924*^9, 
  3.8195298090779347`*^9}, {3.819530060188385*^9, 3.819530060874213*^9}, {
