   3.8195340606823287`*^9}, {3.819534597396369*^9, 3.819534597897561*^9}, {
   3.8195409660241117`*^9, 3.8195409669253006`*^9}, {3.8195428145864964`*^9, 
   3.8195428206536903`*^9}, {3.819542956040408*^9, 3.8195429561030893`*^9}},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[734]:=",ExpressionUUID->"363bfb18-0326-49dd-8720-627e5acf5a0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Finally, the list SampleF below contains 500 adjacency matrices \
corresponding to networks of the the type ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5ec4a832-09e2-4599-9dee-8d6ba9b6345a"],
 " with the parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c3597ca4-87e1-4fa7-b657-e676c1c9f51c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Gamma]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "83ee496b-14cf-4359-823f-8963b18804ed"],
 " set to 0.9 and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", "10"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "073b193a-75f4-44a7-92f0-622e1df836c0"],
 " respectively:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8189316249030848`*^9, 3.8189316281573877`*^9}, {
  3.8189317041203375`*^9, 3.8189317117280035`*^9}, {3.8195272922689514`*^9, 
  3.819527309439098*^9}, {3.8195278692902355`*^9, 3.8195278859914684`*^9}, {
  3.8196412243647013`*^9, 3.819641224927197*^9}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"ff657488-8dbe-4b70-9a56-341848c89a1b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SampleG", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
     RowBox[{"SampleG", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["A", "2"], "[", 
       RowBox[{"0.9", ",", 
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "500"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.818853661903505*^9, {3.818854571953187*^9, 3.818854572484844*^9}, {
   3.818931700427244*^9, 3.81893170131186*^9}, 3.818956149148836*^9, {
   3.819469167338237*^9, 3.8194691729924355`*^9}, {3.8194730504686604`*^9, 
   3.819473052624955*^9}, {3.8196411589576397`*^9, 3.81964115994005*^9}},
 FontSize->11,
 CellLabel->
  "In[887]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7778a23d-78ff-43f5-9930-4ec43b0e14a1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Note that the networks comprising SampleG will generally be disassortative \
as a result of large ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ed1586ad-d196-4d05-9ece-2b2dbb1618eb"],
 " and very negative ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Gamma]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "81fea937-87ad-46b8-b274-b909e5b806e0"],
 ". The following command now generates an adjacency matrix for the network \
of the type ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["A2", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "080b3912-2203-495a-9def-35ebf6ebde1b"],
 " with parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "40a61af8-1cff-4ecc-ae56-2ccd93c743e1"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Gamma]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6430408-b28a-4278-a38f-5b1369c0a2c3"],
 " set to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0.9", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bb08b6f5-cd35-45e9-aa06-05d7c92b637f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", "10"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "15c1a6ed-16ce-4d99-9ee1-dc65e2daa2ce"],
 " respectively. It then creates a list \[CapitalDelta]EvnG whose ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "240f7b3c-26ff-42c2-befb-c37770e4f83c"],
 "-th element yields the dynamical importance of node ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["k", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a74c2fcf-34b9-493a-b2d9-2a8fe84dc98e"],
 " with respect to the network in question:"
}], "Text",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8189540121789503`*^9, 3.8189540171107683`*^9}, {
   3.8195276835555797`*^9, 3.8195277159688587`*^9}, {3.8195277735553007`*^9, 
   3.819527835103825*^9}, {3.8195278946976337`*^9, 3.8195279097237363`*^9}, {
   3.8195302230289373`*^9, 3.819530227435381*^9}, {3.8195413507667274`*^9, 
   3.8195413589296827`*^9}, {3.8195417132569914`*^9, 3.819541715576145*^9}, {
   3.8195418269755244`*^9, 3.819541854371896*^9}, {3.8195422649341564`*^9, 
   3.8195423201316934`*^9}, {3.8195423684760313`*^9, 3.819542432943983*^9}, {
   3.819542710245311*^9, 3.81954271297077*^9}, {3.8195439023462477`*^9, 
   3.819543905065831*^9}, {3.8195439770007615`*^9, 3.819544242501192*^9}, {
   3.81954427335089*^9, 3.819544301686268*^9}, {3.8196408631627913`*^9, 
